<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">55 Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ya kutanguna Paulo kuli Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata ya kutanguna ya Paulo kuli Timoti</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoti</para>
  <para style="imt">BUSANSULUSHI</para>
  <para style="ip">Libuku lya 1 Timoti ni kalata njalalemba mutumwa Paulo yalaya kuli Timoti. Mwakuyeyowa yalalembwa pakati pa (62-64 A.D.) Ici calikuba cindi ca pepi ne mapwililisho a buyumi bwa Paulo. Paulo ne Timoti balikunyumfwana cakwinseti Paulo tunkanda twingi walikumukuwa Timoti eti mwana (Bafilipi 2:22 1 Timoti 1:2, 1:18)</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyi ni imo ya makalata ana alatumwa kubantu, mumusena wa kuya kumubungano. Makalata ambi ni 2 Timoti, Tito, ne Filimoni. 1 Timoti ikute malailile angi alambanga sha kukambila kwa mubungano 2:1-15 Mikalilo yelela batangunishi ba mubungano 3:1-13 Ne kucenjesha sha beshikwiyisha bandemishibili 1:3-11, 4:1-5 Kayi ilaleshenga mbuli Paulo mwalikumwiyishila Timoti kuba mutangunishi mu mibungano. 1 Timoti ikute bumpiyo mpiyo bwingi bwela kunyamfwilisha batangunishi kwendelesha cena mubungano mu masuba ano.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo latatikinga kupa mitende Timoti 1:1-3</para>
  <para style="io1">Lacenjeshenga Timoti sha beshikwiyisha bandemishibili 1:3-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo lapitilishinga kusansulula ncalamulumba Yesu Klistu 1:12-19</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakonkapo lalayanga Timoti sha kukambila ne batangunishi ba mubungano</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo lapwishinga kalata yakendi pakumupa malailile amapwililisho 4-6</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Paulo lapanga mitende Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Njame, Paulo walakwiwa kuba mutumwa wa Klistu Yesu mukupewa mulawo ne Lesa Mupulushi wetu, ne Klistu Yesu uyo ngotwacinkamo manungo,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>ndalembelenga obe Timoti mwaname mwine mwine mulushomo.</para>
  <para style="p">Ndambangeti kwina moyo inkumbo ne lumuno lwa Lesa ne Klistu Yesu Mwami wetu bibe nenjobe.</para>
  <para style="s">Cenjelani ne biyisho byabwepeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mpondalikuya ku Makedoniya, ndalakupa malailile akwambeti wikale ku Efenso kwambeti ukanishenga bantu nabambi baleyishinga ciyisho cabwepeshi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kayi ubambileti kabatatayanga cindi cabo ku tulabi twabakulukulu tulambanga sha masemano. Ibi biliya ncito bikute kuletowa kutotekeshana, nkabikute kwiyishapo sobwe, bilayandanga Lesa bikute kwishibikwa mulushomo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ncondakupelenga malailile awa ni kwambeti ubayishe lusuno lwa ncinencine lulafumunga mu moyo waswepa, kayi kuba ne muntu wamukati waina ne lushomo lwa ncinencine. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bantu nabambi balashiyi mukondo, balataiki ne kuya kuliwala mu makani abula ncito. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Balayandishishinga kuba beshikwiyisha bantu Milawo ya Lesa njalapa Mose, nomba nkabacishi ncobalambanga ne kushininkisha ico ncobaleyishinga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Afwe twashoma kwambeti Milawo yaina na muntu kaisebensesha munshila yalumbuluka. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tucishi kwambeti milawo iliya kubelako cebo ca muntu walulama, nsombi yalabelako kululamika beshi kupwaya milawo, batasuni kululamikwa, kayi batatini Lesa. Ba micito yaipa, baipa myoyo kayi batapaili, beshikushina bashali babo, bakapondo, <verse number="10" style="v"/>bapombo, batuloba beshikona ne batuloba banabo, beshikula ne kulisha bantu, bandemishibili, beshikulumbila cabwepeshi munkuta, kayi beshi kwinsa ciliconse capusana ne ciyisho calumbuluka. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ici ciyisho cikute kucanika mu Mulumbe Waina Lesa Walemekwa welela kulumbaishiwa, uwo ngwalabika mumakasa akame.</para>
  <para style="s">Paulo lalumbunga Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ndalumbunga Klistu Yesu Mwami wetu walampa ngofu ne kunsala kwambeti ndimusebensele, cebo ca kuba washomekwa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nikukabeti ndalikusampula Lesa nekupensha bantu ba Lesa, nsombi Lesa walanyumfwila nkumbo pakwinga paliya ncendalikwishiba nkandalikukute lushomo sobwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba Mwami wetu walanyumfwila nkumbo shinene, ndalatambula lushomo ne lusuno kupitila mukwikatana ne Klistu Yesu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Maswi akwambeti Klistu Yesu walesa pa cishi capanshi kwisa kupulusha bantu babwipishi nakubinga kayi elela kutambulwa ca makasa abili, pa bantu bonse baipa ame ndaipa kupita bonse. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nikukabeco Lesa walanyumfwila nkumbo kwambeti kupitila muli njame ondaipa kupita bonse, Klistu Yesu aleshe kwikalika nkombe kwakendi, kwambeti mbe citondesho kulyabo beti bakamushome kwambeti bakatambule buyumi butapu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lino ku Mwami wa cindi conse, utafu kayi utaboneke Lesa enka, kube bulemu ne kulumbaishiwa kucindi ca cindi. Ameni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Timoti mwaname, ndakupa malailile awa kwelana ne maswi abashinshimi alambwa pali njobe, wasebensesheti byensho, kwambeti ukacikonshe kulwana nkondo yaina. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kayi pitilisha kuba ne lushomo kayi miyeyo yalulama. iyo nabambi njobalanyakili pambali ibyo bilapasulu lushomo lwabo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pakati pa bantu balico pali Humenayo ne Alekisandulo, bantu aba ndabapa cisubulo ne kubanyakila mu bwendeleshi bwa Satana, kwambeti bakaleke kusampula Lesa.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Belela kupaililwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino cakutanguna ndasengengeti mupaililengonga bantu bonse. Kupaila kwenu kube kwa kusenga, mipailo yakukombelela nabambi, kayi ne yakulumba Lesa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mupaililengonga bami, ne bonse bali mubwendeleshi bwacishi kwambeti twikale mulumuno ne buyumi bwaina palumbanga Lesa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ici caina kayi cikute kukondwelesha Lesa Mupulushi wetu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nendi layandangeti bantu bonse bakeshiba cancine ncine bakapulushiwe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Cancine ncine nicakwambeti, kuli Lesa umowa, kayi kuli muntu umowa wemanina bantu kuli Lesa, uyu ni Klistu Yesu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Uyo walalibenga kula nekulubula bantu bonse. Ico calaba citondesho ca pacindi celela, kulesheti Lesa usuni kupulusha bantu bonse. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ici ecebo ncalansalila Lesa kwambeti mbe mutumwa shikukambauka Mulumbe Waina kubantu batamwishi Lesa, nkandabepenga sobwe ndambanga cancine ncine. Ndalasalwa kwambeti njiyishe bantu makani a lushomo ne cancine ncine.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neco, ndayandangeti mpomwabungana, batuloba bapitilishe kupaila kabali bemanika makasa abo kwilu kumupa bulemu Lesa, kwakubula kukalalishanya nambi kupikishana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kayi ndayandangeti batukashi balyapishenga ne byakufwala byelela pakufwala mwabulemu kayi mwa mano, kakutaba kulyapisha kwa kuposa mishishi munshila yanyanyisha, kufwala byabeka beka bya golide, kulikobaika malungu munshingo, nambi byakufwala bya mulo wadula. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nomba kwapa kwabo kube kwa micito yabo yaina kubantu, yelela batukashi balakambilinga Lesa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pacindi ncobaleyinga, batukashi babenga bamwena mwakulicepesha. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Batukashi nkabasuminishiwa kusongomana kwiyisha batuloba nambi kubambila ncobela kwinsa sobwe, nsombi bayiyenga mubumweneneshi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pakwinga Lesa walayambilila kubumba Adamu, katanabumba Eva, <verse number="14" style="v"/>kayi Adamu nteyo walabepwa nsombi Eva ewalabepwa ne kutaluka Mulawo wa Lesa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nomba batukashi nibakapulushiwe cebo ca kusema bana, na bapitilisha kuba ne lushomo nelusuno ne kuba baswepa myoyo, kayi balicepesha.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Batangunishi ba mumubungano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Makani awa na cancine ncine, akwambeti na muntu layandishishinga ncito yakutangunina mubungano layandanga ncito yaina. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mutangunishi wamubungano abe muntu wabula kampenda, weba mukashi umowa, weshikulitibuka, weshikuyeya cena, weshikutambula bensu, kayi ucishi kwiyisha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kataba cakolwa, nambi mukalu, nsombi abe weshi kwinshila bantu byaina, usuni lumuno, kayi wabula nsala ya mali. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Abe wela kwendelesha cena ba mung'anda yakendi kwambeti banabendi bamunyumfwilenga ne kumulemeka. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Na kalilwa kwendelesha cena bali mung'anda yakendi, nomba inga ucikonshaconi kulela mubungano wa Lesa? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kataba muntu wengila calino lino mu mubungano, pakwinga ngaulitukumuna ne kuwila mu bwipishi mbuli calensa Satana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Abe muntu wa cendo caina ngobalalemekenga bantu bakunsa, wela kubula kwikatwa mu kose ka Satana ne kunyumfwa nsoni.</para>
  <para style="s">Beshi kunyamfwilisha mu mubungano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nabo beshi kunyamfwilisha mubungano babe bacendo caina babula ndemi shibili, kabataba bacakolwa nambi bakute nsala ya mali. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bekatisha cangofu miyeyo yancine ncine yalushomo lwalayubuyululwa ne Lesa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kayi bapewe nanshi ncito ya kubabonenapo, na babula kwalilwa basebense ncito ya kunyamfwilisha. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bamakashabo babe balilemeka, babula bufuyishi, batalisumpulu, bashomeka mubintu byonse. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Shikunyamfwilisha mumubungano abe muntu ukute mukashi umo'wa, lendeleshenga cena ba mung'anda yakendi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pakwinga beshi kunyamfwilisha mubungano balasebensenga cena bakute kuba ne mpuwo yaina, kayi bakute kukonsha kwamba makani a lushomo lwabo muli Klistu Yesu cakubula buyowa.</para>
  <para style="s">Cintu cinene casolekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ndakulembelenga makani awa nambi ndayandanga kwisa uko calinolino. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nomba na nkacelwe kwisa, ndalembe kalata iyi kwambeti wishibe ncewela kwinsa mung'anda ya Lesa, uku ekwambeti mubungano wa Lesa muyumi. Mubungano elulindi kayi elupanda lwatabilisha cancine ncine.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Paliya muntu naba umo wela kukaneti kupaila kwetu kwasolekwa nikunene kwa kwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">Nendi walaba muntu</para>
  <para style="q">Mushimu Uswepa walamwinshila bumboni</para>
  <para style="q">Kwambeti walulama</para>
  <para style="q">Walabonwa ne bangelo</para>
  <para style="q">Walakambaukwa ku mishobo yonse</para>
  <para style="q">Bantu pa cishi capanshi balamushoma</para>
  <para style="q">Kayi walatambulwa mwabulemu Kwilu.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Beshikwiyisha bandemishibili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mushimu Uswepa ulambilishingeti bantu nibakataye lushomo mu masuba akupwililisha, nekutatika kunyumfwila mishimu yabwepeshi nekukonkela biyisho bya mishimu yaipa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Biyisho bilico, bantu bandemishibili ebakute miyeyo yafwa, yatentwa ne nshimbi yalungula. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Aba bantu endibo beshikukanisha kweba ne kulya byakula, kakuli Lesa walalenga byakulya kwambeti bashoma kayi bacinshi cancinencine babilye mwakulumba Lesa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ciliconse ncalalenga Lesa caina nkacela kusesemya bantu, na mucikutambula mwakulumba, <verse number="5" style="v"/>pakwinga cikute kuswepeshewa ne maswi a Lesa ne mipailo.</para>
  <para style="s">Musebenshi waina wa Klistu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Na ubeyishenga bintu ibi bantu nabambi, nukabe musebenshi waina wa Klistu Yesu, walalesha kukula mushimba mu biyisho bya lushomo lwetu ne lunyumfwila ndokute kubiyisho bya ca ncinencine mbyolakonkelenga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nikukabeco kotantamuka ku makani a tulabi twabuluya, mbuli tulabi ntobasuna kwamba batukashi bamacembele. Obe pitilisha kusha mano ku buyumi bwaina bwa kupaila Lesa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ee kwishibisha mubili kusebensa ncito nako kwaina pang'ana, nomba kwishibisha mubili kusebensa ncito sha ku mushimu kwapitapo kwina. Pakwinga kukute lulayo mu buyumi bwa cino cindi, kayi mu cindi ca kuntangu, buyumi butapu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Awa ni makani a cancine ncine elela kutambulwa ca makasa abili, kayi ne kwashomwa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Encetulasebenselenga cangofu, pakwinga kupembelela kwetu kuli muli Lesa muyumi, Mupulushi wa bantu bonse makamaka abo bashoma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bayishe bintu ibi, kayi ubambile bensenga ncelabambilinga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kakutaba muntu naba umo eti akunyanshe cebo cakuba kanike, koba cilesho kulyabo bashoma mung'ambilo, ne mucendo nemulusuno ne mulushomo kayi ne mukubula kampenda. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mpaka nkese, kosha mano kukubelenga Mabala a Lesa kwambeti wasansululenga ne kwiyisha cena. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pitilisha kusebensesha cipo ca Mushimu Uswepa cili muli njobe calapewa kuli njobe mpobalakambauka bashinshimi makani a Lesa, abo batangunishi ba mubungano balabika makasa abo pali njobe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Koyeyapo pa bintu ibi mwakushako mano, kwambeti kuya pantangu kwakobe kubonekele kuli bonse. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shako mano ku bintu mbyolenshinga ne kubintu mbyoleyishinga. Pitilisha kwinsa bintu ibi, pakwinga wenseco, obe pamo ne bakunyumfwilinga nimukapuluke.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Malailile kuli bashoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nkabakansa mukulene, nsombi mwambile mwabulemu pakwinga ulyeti baiso. Misepela banobe ubabonengeti bakwenu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>batukashi bamakulene ubabonengeti banyoko, ne batukashi batwanike ubabonengeti bakwenu kwakubula kubakumbwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kopa bulemu bamukalubingi babula pakwikata. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba na mukalubingi ukute bana, nambi bashikulu, abo bana ne bashikulu batangune kwinshila mukowa wabo ncalayandanga Lesa. Mukwinseco bakute kubweshela bashali ne bamankambushabo ncebalikubenshila, ico cikute kukondwelesha Lesa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mukalubingi wabula weshikumunyamfwa nambi kumulama, kupembelela kwakendi wakusha muli Lesa kayi ukute kupitilisha kupaila ne kusenga lunyamfwo kuli Lesa, munshi ne mashiku. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba mukalubingi washa mano mubintu byabula ncito, wafwa kendi nambi ucili muyumi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Naboyo ubape malailile awa kwambeti babule kampenda. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba na muntu katanyamfwa banse bendi makamaka bamung'anda yakendi, lakana lushomo kayi waipa kupita muntu wabula lushomo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kotalemba lina lya mukalubingi pa maina abamukalubingi na nkanashika pabyaka makumi asanu ne limo, kayi abe mukashi walebwapo kumulume umo, <verse number="10" style="v"/>ukute mpuwo yancito shaina. Abe mutukashi walakulisha cena banabendi, kayi walikupa cakulya bantu beshi kupita, kayi walikutambula cena bensu mung'anda yakendi kayi walikunyamfwa bantu mumapensho abo, kayi walikulibenga kwinsa byaina.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bamukalubingi batana bashika byaka makumi asanu ne limo kotabalemba maina. Pakwinga baba ne nyotwa yakuyanda kwebwa, bakute kushiya Klistu, <verse number="12" style="v"/>kayi ingababa ne mulandu wa kupwaya cipangano cabo cakutanguna. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pambali palico, ngababa batolo, bakute cinga cakuya kulibandikisha ku manda abanabo, kufwiya nekwingila mumakani abanabo, ne kwamba makani abula kwelela kwamba. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Caina kwambeti bamukalubingi bacili batwanike bebwe, baseme bana ne kubakulisha cena, kwambeti balwani betu babule cindi ca kutwamba bintu byaipa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kobona, cilenshiki kuli ba mukalubingi batwanike, balatatiki kukonkela Satana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Na pali mutukashi muklistu ukute kulela bamukalubingi apitilishe kubanyamfwa kabataba mutolo ku mubungano, kwambeti mubungano upitilishe kunyamfwa bamukalubingi babula pa kwikata.</para>
  <para style="s">Batangunishi ba mumubungano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Batangunishi ba mubungano balatangunininga cena bapewe bulemu ne malipilo elela ncito ya kukambauka ne kwiyisha. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ici celana ne Mabala a Lesa alambangeti, “Kotasunga ng'ombe matomo kumulomo kwambeti ibule kulya cindi ncolaisebenseshenga mulibala” Kayi “musebenshi wela kutambula malipilo kuli walamwingisha ncito” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kotautambula mulandu wakumubepesha mutangunishi wa mubungano na uliya bakamboni babili nambi batatu bawishi cena mulandu'wo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nambi kulico,bakanse abo balapitilishingo'wa kwinsa bintu byaipa, kwambeti nabambi bamantepo ciyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ndakwambilinga mwangofu pamenso pa Lesa ne Klistu Yesu pamo ne bangelo basalwa, kwambeti ukonke malailile awa kwakubula kulanga pa nkumo, kwambeti ubule kusalulula. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kotafwambananga kubika makasa pa muntu kumuleta mu ncito ya Mwami ya butangunishi mu mubungano, pakwinga wenseco ngaumantamo lubasu mu bwipishi bwakendi. Obe pitilisha kuba wabula kampenda mu buyumi bwakobe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kotanwango'wa menshi onka, konwangonga waini kukunyamfwa kusungulula mulibunda, cebo cakwambeti ukute kukolwa kolwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bwipishi bwa bantu nabambi bukute kuboneka patuba, nambi kabatana bomboloshewa. Nomba bwipishi bwa bantu nabambi bukute kumanta cindi citali kwambeti buboneke. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ni cimo cimo micito yaina ikute kuboneka patuba, nayo itabonekele patuba nkayela kusolekwa sobwe.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Basha bonse bape bulemu bunene abo mbobalasebenselenga kwambeti, kapataba muntu eshasebanye Lina lya Lesa ne ciyisho cetu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mobasha, na mbomulasebenselenga ni banse benu muliklistu kamutabanyanshanga cebo ca kwambeti nibaklistu banenu sobwe, amwe basebenseleni cena, pakwinga bakute kucanamo cena mu ncito shabo ni baklistu, kayi embobasuni.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiyisha kwa bwepeshi ne buboni bwa ncinencine</para>
  <para style="p">Kopitilisha kubeyisha malailile awa ngondakupa kwambeti bakonkelenga. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Muntu leyishinga bintu byapusana ne ibi, lakananga kusuminisha maswi ancinencine a Mwami wetu Yesu Klistu, ne ciyisho cekatana ne buyumi bulalemekeshenga Lesa, <verse number="4" style="v"/>ulico ni muntu shikulisumpula utacishi ciliconse, shikutotekowa. Ici cikute kuletowa munyono, ne kutotekeshanya, ne kutukashana, kayi ne kuyeyelana byaipa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ici cikute kuletowa kulondola pa bantu bakute miyeyo yaipa batakonsho kwishiba ca ncinencine. Balo bakute kuyeyeti kupaila Lesa ni nshila ya kucaninamo bubile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ee, nicakubinga kupaila Lesa kukute kupa muntu kuba wakwana ne bintu mbyakute. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sena pali cintu ncotwalaletelela pacinshi? Paliya! Sena pali cintu nceti tukamantilile pakufumapo? Paliya! <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neco, na katukuteko cakulya, byakufwala ne pakona byopelebyo byakwana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nomba bantu bakute kuyandishisha bubile bakute kuwila mumasunko angi, ne kwikatwa mu tose twabuluya tweshikononga twalunkumbwa lwa mubili lukute kubatwala kulufu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pakwinga kusunisha mali emuyanda wa bintu bingi byaipa. Nabambi bantu pakusunisha mali balataya lushomo ne kuliletela mapensho pa mibili yabo.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulwana nkondo yaina ya lushomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nomba obe muntu wa Lesa, kotamantamo lubasu mu bintu byaipa. Obe lwila bululami, kulemeka Lesa, lushomo, lusuno, kutalekela pakati, ne kuba wabomba moyo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kolwana nkondo yaina ya lushomo, kwambeti ukatambule buyumi butapu, pakwinga ekubuyumi ubu nkwalakukuwila Lesa pasa mpowalikwambilila sha lushomo lwakobe pa menso abantu bangi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pamenso pali Lesa ukute kupa buyumi bintu byonse, kayi ne pamenso pa Klistu Yesu uyo walapa bukamboni bwakendi pantangalala kuli Ponsho Pilato, ndakwambileti, <verse number="14" style="v"/>konkela byonse mbyowalambilwa kwinsa mwakubula kutonshanya mpaka pabusuba mbweshakabwele Mwami Yesu Klistu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lesa ngobakute kulumbaisha bantu bonse, Mwendeleshi wancinencine,wa bendeleshi, Mwami wa bami bonse, endiyeti akapesheti Klistu akabwele kayi pa cindi celela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lesa enkowa eutafu, ewekala mu mumuni utashikwa pepi, paliya muntu walamubonapo, kayi paliya wela kumubona. Lesa apewe bulemu, kayi shakendi ningofu shitapu kucindi ca cindi. Ameni.</para>
  <para style="s">Malailile akupwililisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bacenjesheko bantu babile mucishi kwambeti, kabatatwanga nambi kucinka manungo mububile bwela kutaika cindi ciliconse, nsombi kabashoma Lesa ukute kutupa bintu byonse mwakutandabula cikasa kwambeti afwe tukondwe nebuyumi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bambile kwambeti benshilenga byaina bantu, babe babile mu micito yaina, beshikupako banabo camoyo umo bintu mbyobakute. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Uko ekubunganya bubile bwabo kwambeti bube pebakwa buyumi bwabo bwakuntangu mbweti bakalicanine, ee buyumi bwa ncinencine nditu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Obe Timoti, kobamba cena bintu mbyolapewa mu makasa akobe. Talamuka ku mibandi ne kutotekeshanya kwabuluya kutalete bulemu kuli Lesa uko bantu nkobakute kuboneti, “Emano.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nabambi balataya lushomo cebo cakulibonesheti bakute mano amushoboyu.</para>
  <para style="p">Nkumbo sha Lesa shibe nenjamwe.</para>
</usx>
